<title>MALAYSIA: Arab-Malaysian Finance yr net up.</title>
<headline>Arab-Malaysian Finance yr net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 251.67	vs	   180.69</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)    61.0	 vs	    44.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,537.72	vs	 1,137.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   380.68	vs	   280.17</p>
<p>    Dividend    (percent)   10.0	 vs	    15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Arab-Malaysian Finance Bhd said its earnings per share was adjusted for a one-for-one bonus issue and the dividend was based on an enlarged share capital.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
